    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act as Amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment Act), No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intendsto acquire the land of Beragala Grama Niladhari Division inKegalle District described in the Schedule given below forconstruction of Storage Tank for Water Supply System in theDivisional Secretariat Division of Kegalle.",
